<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>What Happens Next</title>
  <style>
    {{{print_css}}}

    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 12mm;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: #1f1635;
      font-size: 10pt;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .hero,
    .step-card,
    .handoff-box {
      page-break-inside: avoid;
      break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .hero {
      border: 1px solid #ddd6fe;
      background: #faf8ff;
      padding: 1.2em;
      margin-bottom: 1em;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.2em 0;
      font-size: 18pt;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      margin: 0 0 0.35em 0;
      font-size: 11pt;
      color: #5b5370;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin: 0.25em 0;
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.9em;
    }

    .step-card,
    .handoff-box {
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 1em;
    }

    .step-number {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 0.45em;
      padding: 0.18em 0.55em;
      border-radius: 0;
      background: #ede9fe;
      color: #4c1d95;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .step-card h3,
    .handoff-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 0.4em 0;
      font-size: 10.5pt;
      color: #231942;
    }

    .step-card p,
    .handoff-box p {
      margin: 0.3em 0;
    }

    .muted {
      color: #6b7280;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="lh-s8-premium lh-s8-one-page lh-s8-next-guide">
  <div class="s8-document-intro s8-document-intro--compact">
    <div>
      <div class="s8-eyebrow">Section 8 supporting document</div>
      <h1>What happens next</h1>
      <p><strong>{{status_label}}</strong></p>
      <p>{{next_step_text}}</p>
    </div>
    <svg class="s8-artwork" viewBox="0 0 150 125" role="img" aria-label="Notice timeline leading to the next stage">
      <path class="wash" d="M19 18c27-16 75-10 102 12 31 26 30 67 2 88-30 22-81 12-105-17-20-25-19-69 1-83z"/>
      <line class="ink" x1="20" y1="77" x2="130" y2="77"/>
      <circle class="accent" cx="30" cy="77" r="10" fill="white"/>
      <circle class="accent" cx="75" cy="77" r="10" fill="white"/>
      <circle class="accent" cx="120" cy="77" r="10" fill="white"/>
      <path class="accent" d="M35 77h30M80 77h30" fill="none"/>
      <rect class="ink" x="16" y="25" width="43" height="33" rx="2" fill="white"/>
      <line class="accent" x1="24" y1="36" x2="50" y2="36"/>
      <line class="accent" x1="24" y1="46" x2="44" y2="46"/>
      <rect class="ink" x="94" y="23" width="42" height="35" rx="2" fill="white"/>
      <path class="accent" d="M95 26l20 16 20-16" fill="none"/>
      <path class="ink" d="M48 104h53" fill="none"/>
      <path class="accent" d="M94 97l8 7-8 7" fill="none"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="steps">
    {{#each next_steps}}
    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-number">Step {{step}}</div>
      <h3>{{title}}</h3>
      <p>{{detail}}</p>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </div>

  <div class="s8-page-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="support-illustration:what-happens-next" alt="" />
  </div>

  <div class="handoff-box">
    {{#if (eq pack_stage "stage1")}}
    <h3>If you need to go to court</h3>
    <p>If this proceeds to court, the Stage 2 Court & Possession Pack builds directly on this file.</p>
    <p class="muted">The same notice, service record, {{#if has_arrears_grounds}}arrears position{{else}}evidence for each ground{{/if}}, and core facts should carry forward without being rebuilt from scratch.</p>
    {{else}}
    <h3>After court preparation</h3>
    <p>Keep the issued claim, service record, hearing bundle, and any later enforcement papers aligned in the same case file.</p>
    <p class="muted">This pack continues the case started with the notice. The more clearly the notice, claim, hearing bundle, and enforcement papers line up, the less room there is for avoidable challenge.</p>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
</body>
</html>
